; Scoped matching-low route: entry low47, immutable page-safe prior link0A/0B.
;18 emitted bytes /33 cycles; existing CPU entry7 + ROM indirect stub7 separate.
; CPU frame3 plus own P/A2 bytes; X/Y unchanged, P saved before A.
; Exact PA7F-before-marker order; prior full route remains reachable once.
; Existing ROM, external retained owner, STOP and aggregate NMI costs Unknown.
callback:
php
pha
cld
lda #$7f
sta $dc00
lda #1
sta marker
pla
plp
jmp ($000a)
